- "<h1 id=\"blocks\">Blocks</h1>\n<h2 id=\"quotes\">Quotes</h2>\n<blockquote><p>One quote</p></blockquote><blockquote><p>A separate quote</p></blockquote><blockquote><p>One quote, carried over two lines.</p></blockquote><blockquote><p>Quote parent</p><blockquote><p>Nested quote</p></blockquote></blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"classed-quotes\">Classed Quotes</h2>\n<blockquote class=\"hero\"><p>Classed quote</p></blockquote><blockquote class=\"note\"><p>Another quote, with its own class</p></blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"block-form\">Block Form</h2>\n<ul><li>Reading notes<ul><li>Chapter 3 was particularly relevant:<blockquote><p>quote from chapter 3</p></blockquote>\n</li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"block-form-heading\">Block form heading</h2>\n<h2 id=\"table\">Table</h2>\n<table><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>Color</th></tr><tr><td>Apple</td><td>Fruit</td><td>Red</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Carrot</strong></td><td>Vegetable</td><td>Orange</td></tr><tr><td>Blueberry</td><td>Fruit</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"free-block\">Free Block</h2>\n<div>\n<p>Grouped by a free marker.</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n</div>\n"
